 esc         one step back     ctrl+s   choose sources|
 ctrl+c      quit GoAnime     r        from the start|
 ?           this help     e        episodes|
     x        remove|
LISTS     X        clear the list|
 type        filter the list|
 g G         first, last|
 pgup pgdn   page|
|
esc never quits. ctrl+c always does.|
